# Custom menu entries (Mod+Space).
# Format, one entry per line:   Label | mode | command
#
# Modes:
#   term  terminal that closes when the command ends
#   hold  terminal left open at the end ("Enter to close")
#   run   runs in the background, without a terminal (graphical applications)
#
# Add from the menu: Custom entries > Add an entry. Lines starting with # are ignored.

